# direnv: auto-enter the pinned toolchain and the `bbx` shim. The flake sits
# at the repo ROOT so it can see Cargo.toml and src/, which a flake in a
# subdirectory cannot.
use flake

# Per-machine settings -- BBX_ENDPOINT above all, since the box that serves
# the model is a fact about YOUR network and not about this repo. Sourced
# AFTER the flake because the flake defaults with `:=` and must not win.
# Untracked; see docs/CONTRIBUTING.md.
source_env_if_exists .envrc.local
